# Vercel Hobby static upload limit is 100MB. Full photography + PDFs in
# public/media are ~490MB and already live on ambiencehomedesign.com —
# resolveMediaSrc remaps them at runtime when NEXT_PUBLIC_REMOTE_MEDIA=1.
# Keep small partner marks/SVGs in the deploy for SupplierExplorer.
public/media/**
!public/media/partners/
!public/media/partners/**
